### Tool Priority (Built-in first, self-built fallback)

| Need | ✅ Prefer (built-in) | 🔄 Fallback (self-built) |
|------|---------------------|-------------------------|
| Semantic code search | `codebase_search` (vector/semantic) | CodeGraph.search() (TF-IDF) |
